All four former silent branches now return contextual wrapped errors, and `Workflow.YAML()` checks `toYAML()` before allocating or invoking the outer encoder. The internal DTO field types are fixed serializable structs, so no artificial injection seam was added. Existing workflow canonical output, round-trip, runner, gate, default-runner, and retros tests all pass, proving valid output did not change.

